# Normalise line endings: every text file is stored with LF and checked out with LF on every
# machine, regardless of core.autocrlf. Added 2026-10-09 because autocrlf=true on Windows was
# checking files out as CRLF while Prettier expects LF, producing thousands of "Delete ␍" lint
# warnings that buried real findings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.db binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
